    {
      "id": "s0001",
      "text": "Bridge — From Forming to Renewing",
      "startMs": 0.0,
      "endMs": 2821.0,
      "charStart": 0,
      "charEnd": 33
    },
    {
      "id": "s0002",
      "text": "Once attention has a steady address, information and adjustment begin to matter.",
      "startMs": 3936.0,
      "endMs": 8975.0,
      "charStart": 35,
      "charEnd": 115
    },
    {
      "id": "s0003",
      "text": "Part II—Renewing—follows the loop that keeps a group tied to what is actually happening—not only to what was decided last time.",
      "startMs": 8975.0,
      "endMs": 18170.0,
      "charStart": 115,
      "charEnd": 242
    },
    {
      "id": "s0004",
      "text": "Dissent is Welcomed.",
      "startMs": 18669.0,
      "endMs": 20318.0,
      "charStart": 245,
      "charEnd": 265
    },
    {
      "id": "s0005",
      "text": "Feedback Drives Change. **Leaders Feel the Consequences.** When these three hold together, the group can still correct course while the cost of change is small.",
      "startMs": 20318.0,
      "endMs": 31719.0,
